["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/diskImage", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The Element refers to a disk image that can be written to a disk, booted in a VM, etc. A disk image typically contains most or all of the components necessary to boot, such as bootloaders, kernels, firmware, userspace, etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
